{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Experience the core gameplay of <i>Path of Gear: Blacksmith\u2019s Legend</i> right away! The demo includes the following features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full Chapter 1 Playable\u00a0-</strong> Get an early look at the first of three story chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20+ Equipment Affixes\u00a0-</strong> Mix and match weapon and armor traits to create your own combat style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dozens of Random Events\u00a0-</strong> Every run delivers a unique and unpredictable adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>6 Distinct Monster Types\u00a0-</strong> Each enemy features unique mechanics and tactical challenges.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The full release will feature a deeper and more expansive experience, including</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character Talent System\u00a0-</strong> Customize and refine your personal combat style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New Facilities Unlocked</strong>\u00a0<strong>-</strong> Gain access to the Library, Adventurer\u2019s Guild, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expanded Cooking Options</strong>\u00a0<strong>-</strong> Strategically combine meals for optimal performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Massive Affix Expansion\u00a0-</strong> 80+ weapons \u00d7 30+ armors\u2014endless customization possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Additional Monster Types\u00a0-</strong> Each battle brings new surprises and difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Extended Story Chapters\u00a0-</strong> Uncover the world\u2019s secrets across three full chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Greater Event Variety\u00a0-</strong> A blend of narrative-driven and random events offers fresh experiences every time.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><im